  "description": "TrueVisions NOW – Live Sports & Premium Entertainment All in One App\n\nNever miss a match or your favorite show with the TrueVisions NOW app. Enjoy world-class live sports, replays, and premium entertainment anytime, anywhere.\n\nLive sports from around the world\n*Top global sports including UEFA Champions League, LaLiga, and other leading European football leagues.\n*Formula 1, MotoGP, Tennis Grand Slams, Badminton, Golf, Snooker, UFC, ASEAN Hyundai Cup, and more.\n*Professional live broadcasts with expert Thai commentators from TrueVisions.\n*Full coverage with pre-match, post-match, highlights, and replays.\n\nPremium entertainment\n*Popular series from Thailand, China, Korea, and Japan.\n*Blockbuster movies from Hollywood and Asia.\n*K-Pop, variety shows, anime, world-class documentaries, and leading news channels.\n\nPowerful features for flexible viewing\n*Watch live and replay programs up to 7 days with Catch Up.\n*Timeshift lets you instantly rewind live TV, even after a program has started.\n...",
